<h1 data-copy-en="Vespa" data-copy-zh="Vespa">Vespa</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Vespa’s castle route, court requirements, referral letter and post-recruitment schedule." data-copy-zh="Vespa的城堡路线、宫廷条件、介绍信与招募后日程。">Vespa’s castle route, court requirements, referral letter and post-recruitment schedule.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Vespa</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="All15_Shared_Island_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_with_Vespa"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sirena_Isle_Vacation_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_.2322_Setup_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_#22_Setup_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Complete_Court_Recruitment_Sequence"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Closer"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="No_Crown_Voice"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Private_Air"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Castle_Conversations_and_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Ordinary_Affection_and_Referral_Letter"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Vespa — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/vespa.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Vespa — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/vespa.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Vespa — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Vespa’s early conversations and dates are based at the castle. A separate twenty-step court sequence leads to her later worker activities. Plan the optional castle dates before completing that recruitment sequence.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Stats_and_Schedule"></span><h2>Where to find Vespa</h2><p>Before recruitment: Castle Garden daily 10:00–18:00 and Princess Bedroom 19:00–24:00. After recruitment: Vespa’s Room 09:00–14:00 and 20:00–24:00; Elara’s Office on even days 14:00–16:00.</p><p>Her additional garden, bar and VIP visits require the corresponding active workers as well: Audrey for the garden, Brandy for the bar, Vixen for VIP. Their times are shown in the schedule reference.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Castle Garden</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Condition">before recruitment</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Princess Bedroom</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">19:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Condition">before recruitment</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Vespa's Room</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">09:00–14:00; 20:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Condition">after recruitment</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Elara's Office</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">even days, 14:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Condition">after recruitment</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">VIP Lounge</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">odd days, 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Condition">Vespa and Vixen active</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Garden</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">even days, 16:00–19:00</td><td data-label="Condition">Vespa and Audrey active</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Bar</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">odd days, 18:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Condition">Vespa and Brandy active</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Private Air at Known (25) opens the personal conversation chain. Festival Date at Friend (100) follows it; No Crown Voice follows at Friend, then Closer at Close Friend (200). Night Bazaar needs Festival Date and No Crown Voice; Moonlit Courtyard needs Night Bazaar and Closer.</p><p>Moonlit Courtyard is available only before she joins the business. Complete it and the castle heart-to-hearts first if you want them in the same timeline. The court sequence has its own rising Reputation and cross-character requirements, ending at Intimate (1600), business Reputation 18 and the required Elara/Annette milestones.</p><details><summary>Automatic encounters: complete start conditions</summary><p>Enter the indicated location during its scene window. These encounters complete once; fixed base relationship rewards below are separate from choice bonuses. A missing hour restriction means the scene itself has no extra clock gate.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Encounter</th><th scope="col">Start location / hours</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Fixed base relationship</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Chamberlain's Inspection</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Elara's Office; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Elara Known (25); Lord Chamberlain Known (25); after Royal Revenue Review; business Reputation 5; not vacationing: Elara</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Elara +5 / Lord Chamberlain +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Numbers She Heard</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Castle Garden; 15:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Vespa Acknowledged (10); after The Chamberlain's Inspection / The Princess Without An Audience; business Reputation 6</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Vespa +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Prince's First Sneer</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Castle Courtyard; 11:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Prince Barnard Acknowledged (10); after The Numbers She Heard / A Prince In The Room; business Reputation 7</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Prince Barnard +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Gatehouse Warning</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Castle Courtyard; 07:00–11:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">after A Prince's First Sneer; business Reputation 8</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Annette +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Elara Returns To Court</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Throne Room; 10:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Elara Known (25); The King Acknowledged (10); after The Gatehouse Warning; business Reputation 9; not vacationing: Elara</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Elara +8 / The King +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Private Questions</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Princess Bedroom; 20:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Vespa Known (25); after Elara Returns To Court; business Reputation 10</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Vespa +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Prince Demands Respect</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Noble Quarter; 16:00–19:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Prince Barnard Acknowledged (10); after Private Questions; business Reputation 11</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Prince Barnard +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Captain's Security Audit</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Elara's Office; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Elara Known (25); after The Prince Demands Respect; business Reputation 12; not vacationing: Elara</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Elara +6 / Gruff +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Cloak At The Door</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Rose &amp; Thorn; 18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Vespa Friend (100); after The Captain's Security Audit; business Reputation 13</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Vespa +12</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Chamberlain's Private Offer</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Throne Room; 17:00–19:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Lord Chamberlain Known (25); after A Cloak At The Door; business Reputation 14</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Lord Chamberlain +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Rumor With Good Breeding</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Castle Courtyard; 11:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Prince Barnard Known (25); after The Chamberlain's Private Offer; business Reputation 15</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Prince Barnard +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Suitor Refused</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Throne Room; 10:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Vespa Close Friend (200); The King Acknowledged (10); Prince Barnard Known (25); after A Rumor With Good Breeding; business Reputation 16</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Vespa +12 / The King +4 / Prince Barnard +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Side Gate</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Castle Courtyard; 07:00–11:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Vespa Close Friend (200); Annette Acknowledged (10); after The Suitor Refused; business Reputation 17</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Vespa +10 / Annette +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Elara's Terms</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Elara's Office; 18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Elara Friend (100); Vespa Crush (400); after The Side Gate; business Reputation 18; not vacationing: Elara</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Elara +10 / Vespa +12</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Unsigned Form</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Throne Room; 10:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">The King Known (25); Lord Chamberlain Acquaintance (50); Prince Barnard Acquaintance (50); after Elara's Terms; business Reputation 18</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">The King +6 / Lord Chamberlain +8 / Prince Barnard +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No One Encouraged Me</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Princess Bedroom; 20:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Vespa Romantic (800); after The Unsigned Form; business Reputation 18</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Vespa +15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Narrow Language</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Elara's Office; 18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Elara Friend (100); Lord Chamberlain Acquaintance (50); after No One Encouraged Me / Festival Date with Vespa; business Reputation 18; not vacationing: Elara</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Elara +10 / Lord Chamberlain +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Witnesses And Ink</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Elara's Office; 18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Elara Friend (100); Vespa Intimate (1600); Annette Acknowledged (10); after Narrow Language / Night Bazaar Date with Vespa; business Reputation 18; not vacationing: Elara</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Elara +8 / Vespa +15 / Annette +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Princess Signs</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Elara's Office; 18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Elara Friend (100); Vespa Intimate (1600); Annette Known (25); after Witnesses And Ink; business Reputation 18; not vacationing: Elara</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Elara +10 / Vespa +25 / Annette +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Princess Without An Audience</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Castle Garden; 10:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Vespa +10</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Private Air</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Castle Garden; 10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">75 min; −15 Energy; +5 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Festival Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Castle Garden; 10:00–14:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after Private Air</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $80; −35 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Crown Voice</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Princess Bedroom; 19:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after Private Air</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; −15 Energy; +8 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Closer</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Princess Bedroom; 19:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after No Crown Voice</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; −20 Energy; +10 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Night Bazaar</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Princess Bedroom; 20:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Festival Date with Vespa / No Crown Voice</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $100; −35 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Moonlit Courtyard Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Princess Bedroom; 20:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Night Bazaar Date with Vespa / Closer</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; −30 Energy; +10 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Talk gives 1 base point, four safe uses shared across locations. Give Chocolates takes 15 minutes and one Chocolate for 3 base points, up to three daily.</p><p>Letter of Introduction at Close Friend (200) requires business ownership and costs 30 minutes plus 3 Crystals. It grants the Noble Referral Letter once; it is separate from completing the court recruitment chain.</p><p>After recruitment, her room supports Talk and chocolates. Worker training, resort activities, shared venue scenes and crafted upgrades have separate menus and prerequisites.</p><p>Relationship rewards are base values unless marked direct. Shared relationship modifiers affect the final gain. Repeated actions keep their daily allowance when you meet the same character elsewhere.</p><details><summary>Relationship bonuses</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Reference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Favorite stats</th><td data-label="Reference">Charm 90 / Intelligence 85 / attractiveness 90</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relationship skill</th><td data-label="Reference">Silver Tongue</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Favorite-stat contribution scales toward the listed values. The relationship skill affects the shared relationship multiplier; it is not automatically a skill taught by this character.</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Vespa</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Castle Garden; 10:00–18:00<br/>Princess Bedroom; 19:00–24:00<br/>Vespa's Room; 09:00–14:00; 20:00–24:00<br/>Elara's Office; even days, 14:00–16:00<br/>VIP Lounge; odd days, 16:00–18:00<br/>Garden; even days, 16:00–19:00<br/>The Bar; odd days, 18:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +1; 4 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Chocolates</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Castle Garden; 10:00–18:00<br/>Princess Bedroom; 19:00–24:00<br/>Vespa's Room; 09:00–14:00; 20:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min; Chocolate ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +3; 3 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Letter of Introduction</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Castle Garden; 10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); own the business</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min; Crystal ×3</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>Heart-to-heart reward reference</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Conversation</th><th scope="col">Best ordinary base total</th><th scope="col">Useful special replies</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Private Air</th><td data-label="Best ordinary base total">60</td><td data-label="Useful special replies">round 2: Charm 45 (+3 base)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Crown Voice</th><td data-label="Best ordinary base total">73</td><td data-label="Useful special replies">round 2: Intelligence 45 (+1 base)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Closer</th><td data-label="Best ordinary base total">87</td><td data-label="Useful special replies">round 2: Charm 60 (+1 base)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>These totals describe the best ordinary choices, before relationship modifiers. A special reply can improve the reward; it is not required just to finish the conversation. Romantic adds 25 final relationship points on completion.</p></details></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Gallery_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>Affection alone cannot advance the court: business Reputation, the named prior court scene and other participants’ stages all matter. Castle portraits disappear after recruitment. Refer to the full court reference below if a numbered objective is stalled.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships, dates and intimacy</a> · <a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Brothel operations</a> · <a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Sirena Isle Resort</a> · <a href="character-elara.html">Elara</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-All15_Shared_Island_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_with_Vespa"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sirena_Isle_Vacation_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_.2322_Setup_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_#22_Setup_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Complete_Court_Recruitment_Sequence"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Closer"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-No_Crown_Voice"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Private_Air"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Castle_Conversations_and_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Ordinary_Affection_and_Referral_Letter"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Vespa 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/vespa.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Vespa 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/vespa.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Vespa 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Vespa前期的谈心和约会都从城堡发起，另一条20步宫廷序列则通向后续员工活动。想完成可选城堡约会的话，请安排在招募序列结束之前。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Stats_and_Schedule"></span><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>招募前，每天10:00—18:00在城堡花园、19:00—24:00在公主卧室。招募后改为Vespa的房间09:00—14:00及20:00—24:00，双数日14:00—16:00还在Elara的办公室。</p><p>额外的花园、酒吧与VIP休息室拜访还要求对应员工启用：花园需要Audrey，酒吧需要Brandy，VIP休息室需要Vixen；具体时间见日程表。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">城堡花园</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">招募前</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">公主卧室</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">19:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">招募前</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Vespa的房间</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">09:00–14:00；20:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">招募后</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Elara的办公室</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">双数日，14:00–16:00</td><td data-label="条件">招募后</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">VIP休息室</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">单数日，16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Vespa与Vixen员工启用</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">花园</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">双数日，16:00–19:00</td><td data-label="条件">Vespa与Audrey员工启用</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">酒吧</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">单数日，18:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">Vespa与Brandy员工启用</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>已知（25）的私密清风开启个人谈心链。朋友（100）时，在它之后开放庆典约会；同为朋友阶段开放无冠之声，再于亲密朋友（200）开放更近一步。夜市要求庆典约会和无冠之声，月下庭院约会则要求夜市和更近一步。</p><p>月下庭院约会只在她加入青楼前开放。若想在同一时间线完成，建议先做完它与城堡谈心。宫廷序列另有逐步提高的声誉和跨角色要求，最后需要亲密（1600）、青楼声誉18，以及Elara和Annette的对应里程碑。</p><details><summary>展开自动事件的完整开始条件</summary><p>在事件时段进入指定地点即可触发。均为一次性事件，下列固定基础关系奖励与选择奖励另算；未列额外时段表示事件本身不再加设时间限制。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">开始地点／时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">固定基础关系奖励</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">宫务大臣的视察</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">Elara的办公室; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Elara 已知（25）；Lord Chamberlain 已知（25）；完成：皇家收入审查；青楼声誉5；未在度假：Elara</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Elara +5、Lord Chamberlain +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">她听见的数字</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">城堡花园; 15:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">Vespa 已遇见（10）；完成：宫务大臣的视察、没有观众的公主；青楼声誉6</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Vespa +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">王子的第一声冷笑</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">城堡庭院; 11:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件">Prince Barnard 已遇见（10）；完成：她听见的数字、房间里的王子；青楼声誉7</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Prince Barnard +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">门楼警告</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">城堡庭院; 07:00–11:00</td><td data-label="条件">完成：王子的第一声冷笑；青楼声誉8</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Annette +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Elara重返宫廷</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">王座厅; 10:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">Elara 已知（25）；The King 已遇见（10）；完成：门楼警告；青楼声誉9；未在度假：Elara</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Elara +8、The King +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">私下的问题</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">公主卧室; 20:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">Vespa 已知（25）；完成：Elara重返宫廷；青楼声誉10</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Vespa +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">王子要求尊重</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">贵族区; 16:00–19:00</td><td data-label="条件">Prince Barnard 已遇见（10）；完成：私下的问题；青楼声誉11</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Prince Barnard +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">卫队长的安全审查</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">Elara的办公室; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Elara 已知（25）；完成：王子要求尊重；青楼声誉12；未在度假：Elara</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Elara +6、Gruff +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">门前的斗篷</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">玫瑰与荆棘; 18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">Vespa 朋友（100）；完成：卫队长的安全审查；青楼声誉13</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Vespa +12</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">宫务大臣的私下提议</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">王座厅; 17:00–19:00</td><td data-label="条件">Lord Chamberlain 已知（25）；完成：门前的斗篷；青楼声誉14</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Lord Chamberlain +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一个有良好教养的谣言</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">城堡庭院; 11:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件">Prince Barnard 已知（25）；完成：宫务大臣的私下提议；青楼声誉15</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Prince Barnard +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">被拒绝的求婚者</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">王座厅; 10:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">Vespa 亲密朋友（200）；The King 已遇见（10）；Prince Barnard 已知（25）；完成：一个有良好教养的谣言；青楼声誉16</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Vespa +12、The King +4、Prince Barnard +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">侧门</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">城堡庭院; 07:00–11:00</td><td data-label="条件">Vespa 亲密朋友（200）；Annette 已遇见（10）；完成：被拒绝的求婚者；青楼声誉17</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Vespa +10、Annette +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Elara 的条款</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">Elara的办公室; 18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">Elara 朋友（100）；Vespa 迷恋（400）；完成：侧门；青楼声誉18；未在度假：Elara</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Elara +10、Vespa +12</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未签名表格</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">王座厅; 10:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">The King 已知（25）；Lord Chamberlain 相识（50）；Prince Barnard 相识（50）；完成：Elara 的条款；青楼声誉18</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">The King +6、Lord Chamberlain +8、Prince Barnard +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">没有人鼓励我</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">公主卧室; 20:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">Vespa 浪漫感（800）；完成：未签名表格；青楼声誉18</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Vespa +15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">限定措辞</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">Elara的办公室; 18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">Elara 朋友（100）；Lord Chamberlain 相识（50）；完成：没有人鼓励我、与Vespa的节日约会；青楼声誉18；未在度假：Elara</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Elara +10、Lord Chamberlain +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">证人和墨水</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">Elara的办公室; 18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">Elara 朋友（100）；Vespa 亲密（1600）；Annette 已遇见（10）；完成：限定措辞、与Vespa的夜市约会；青楼声誉18；未在度假：Elara</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Elara +8、Vespa +15、Annette +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">公主签名</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">Elara的办公室; 18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">Elara 朋友（100）；Vespa 亲密（1600）；Annette 已知（25）；完成：证人和墨水；青楼声誉18；未在度假：Elara</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Elara +10、Vespa +25、Annette +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">没有观众的公主</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">城堡花园; 10:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Vespa +10</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">私密清风</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">城堡花园; 10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">75分钟；−15 精力；+5 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">庆典约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">城堡花园; 10:00–14:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：私密清风</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富80；−35 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">无冠之声</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">公主卧室; 19:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：私密清风</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90分钟；−15 精力；+8 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">更近一步</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">公主卧室; 19:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：无冠之声</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90分钟；−20 精力；+10 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">夜市</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">公主卧室; 20:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：与Vespa的节日约会、无冠之声</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富100；−35 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">月下庭院约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">公主卧室; 20:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：与Vespa的夜市约会、更近一些</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；−30 精力；+10 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>交谈每次给予1点基础关系，各地点共用每日4次安全额度。送巧克力消耗15分钟及一份巧克力，获得3点基础关系，每日最多3次。</p><p>介绍信要求亲密朋友（200）且已拥有青楼，消耗30分钟和3水晶，一次性取得贵族推荐信，与完成宫廷招募链是两回事。</p><p>招募后的房间提供交谈与巧克力。员工训练、度假活动、共同场所事件及制作升级，各有自己的菜单与前置条件。</p><p>除注明直接增加外，关系奖励均为基础值，最终增量受共通关系修正影响。同一角色换地点不会重置重复动作的每日额度。</p><details><summary>展开关系加成参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">类别</th><th scope="col">参考</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">偏好属性</th><td data-label="参考">魅力 90、智力 85、吸引力 90</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">关系加成技能</th><td data-label="参考">巧舌如簧</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>偏好属性的加成随数值提高，逐步达到所列参考值。关系加成技能影响共通关系倍率，不代表该角色一定负责教授这项技能。</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和Vespa交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">城堡花园; 10:00–18:00<br/>公主卧室; 19:00–24:00<br/>Vespa的房间; 09:00–14:00；20:00–24:00<br/>Elara的办公室; 双数日，14:00–16:00<br/>VIP休息室; 单数日，16:00–18:00<br/>花园; 双数日，16:00–19:00<br/>酒吧; 单数日，18:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+1；4次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送巧克力</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">城堡花园; 10:00–18:00<br/>公主卧室; 19:00–24:00<br/>Vespa的房间; 09:00–14:00；20:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15分钟；巧克力 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+3；3次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">介绍信</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">城堡花园; 10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；已拥有青楼</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30分钟；水晶 ×3</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>展开谈心奖励参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">谈心</th><th scope="col">最佳普通选择基础总值</th><th scope="col">实用特殊回复条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">私密清风</th><td data-label="最佳普通选择基础总值">60</td><td data-label="实用特殊回复条件">第2轮: 魅力 45（+3基础点）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">无冠之声</th><td data-label="最佳普通选择基础总值">73</td><td data-label="实用特殊回复条件">第2轮: 智力 45（+1基础点）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">更近一些</th><td data-label="最佳普通选择基础总值">87</td><td data-label="实用特殊回复条件">第2轮: 魅力 60（+1基础点）</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>总值为普通选项的最佳基础合计，尚未套用关系修正。特殊回复可提高奖励，但不是完成谈心的必要条件；学会浪漫后，完成时另加25点最终关系。</p></details></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Gallery_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>单靠好感不能推进宫廷：青楼声誉、前一项宫廷事件，以及其他参与者关系都要满足。招募后城堡头像会消失。序列中的目标卡住时，可展开下方完整宫廷参考。</p></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系、约会与亲密互动</a> · <a href="game-systems-brothel.html">青楼经营</a> · <a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">塞壬岛度假村</a> · <a href="character-elara.html">Elara</a></p></section>
